# NOTE: Odoo addon test suites live in `tests/` directories and are the safety
# net for every module here, so they are tracked. They used to be ignored by a
# blanket `tests/` / `test_*.py` / `*_test.py` rule, which silently excluded all
# of them (and ops scripts such as ops_cleanup_mail_test.py). Scratch files, if
# any appear, belong under a name listed below rather than a pattern that also
# catches the suites.

